  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "稻仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span><span><b>姚雅芳</b></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">驚蟄（kenn-ti̍t）到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春雷一tân萬物醒</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">燕仔飛--來--ah　來去掖秧仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">佈田花開--ah　來去佈稻仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">穀雨到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">稻仔葉親像伊ê雙手</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雙手ē-tàng來遮雨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　吹過稻仔葉si-si-su̍t-su̍t&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In親像leh講細聲話</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　吹過稻仔葉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In親像beh hām我a̋i-sat-tsuh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　吹過稻仔葉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In ná拍phik ná唱歌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　吹過稻仔葉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">In ê身軀ná搖ná跳舞</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">芒種到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">原來稻仔已經leh做kuī</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">稻仔穗ná tàm頭ná講是是是</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">立夏到</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規phiàn黃金閃閃爍</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講伊已經真飽tīnn</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家緊來割稻仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">合齊提去曝粟仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今年稻仔好收成</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ē-tàng歡喜等過年</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">稻仔　稻仔真感謝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo阮逐日有飯thang食</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">感謝天　感謝地&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo阮年年收成濟濟濟</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRBH5pHvjd7YXKjqPro6zs3EBuUTPfuouF531puEsnHq6mE8zV3ALf0GZWuxq5IM6TBAQ0UouV-uL0tofcr-0Zqez_7ULE8dvUqI8G3ZzG3oRWVSuMefD5COhfwNFLjsAJ_5A6EbEdjwuxAab-KgXCYCt16wjuyO6a1iNfZpXwViJPJInLheBpLdlgXw/s1477/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E8%A9%A9%20%E5%A7%9A%E9%9B%85%E8%8A%B3%20%E7%A8%BB%E4%BB%94%2020220316.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1108\" data-original-width=\"1477\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRBH5pHvjd7YXKjqPro6zs3EBuUTPfuouF531puEsnHq6mE8zV3ALf0GZWuxq5IM6TBAQ0UouV-uL0tofcr-0Zqez_7ULE8dvUqI8G3ZzG3oRWVSuMefD5COhfwNFLjsAJ_5A6EbEdjwuxAab-KgXCYCt16wjuyO6a1iNfZpXwViJPJInLheBpLdlgXw/w640-h480/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E8%A9%A9%20%E5%A7%9A%E9%9B%85%E8%8A%B3%20%E7%A8%BB%E4%BB%94%2020220316.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></span></a></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><span><br /></span></span><p></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/s1421/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%